Stable native accelerometer release after PR #48 merged as `e554d54da8f2956ac3533d9a87d8bf078896fc09`.

Release source is the exact phone-tested PR head `96693a1f341bf9190a2d583c635f230f6c73ebdb`. The attached APK is the retained output built from that source; it was not rebuilt for publication.

Final physical-phone evidence observed for this exact APK:
- installed and displayed on the real ARMv7 phone;
- centered mid-screen layout;
- larger X/Y/Z text;
- lowercase SI unit rendered as `m/s²`;
- nearly full-width tracks;
- substantially thicker active bars;
- increased vertical spacing between axis rows.

The supplied final screenshot is evidence of the visual presentation. It is not, by itself, a new dynamic-redraw test. Continuous accelerometer redraw and gravity shifting between axes were observed earlier on the same sensor path; PR #48 changes presentation only and does not change sensor sampling or values.

